[
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:0.1"], "en": "Buddhavamsa 8.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:0.2"], "en": "The Lineage of the Buddha Sobhita:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:1.1"], "en": "\"After Revata...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:1.2"], "en": "The Leader named Sobhita was concentrated,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:1.3"], "en": "with a peaceful mind—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:1.4"], "en": "unequaled, without a peer.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:2.1"], "en": "Thus the Victor,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:2.2", "PA_bv_8:2.3"], "en": "having attained complete enlightenment, turned his mind away from his own home.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:2.4"], "en": "He set the Wheel of Dhamma in motion,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:3.1", "PA_bv_8:3.2"], "en": "from the Avīci hell below up to the peak of existence above.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:3.3"], "en": "During this interval,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:3.4", "PA_bv_8:4.1"], "en": "there was a single assembly for the teaching of the Dhamma. By that assembly, the Sambuddha—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:4.2"], "en": "He set the Wheel of Dhamma in motion;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:4.3", "PA_bv_8:4.4"], "en": "the first realization was beyond all counting.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:5.1", "PA_bv_8:5.2"], "en": "Furthermore, while he was teaching in the assembly of the gods,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:5.3"], "en": "there were ninety thousand koṭis.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:5.4"], "en": "The second realization occurred.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:6.1"], "en": "Furthermore, there was another son of a king,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:6.2"], "en": "a kshatriya named Jayasena.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:6.3"], "en": "Having planted a grove,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:6.4"], "en": "he then offered it to the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:7.1"], "en": "Proclaiming his sacrifice, [the Buddha said:]", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:7.2"], "en": "The Visionary One taught the Dhamma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:7.3", "PA_bv_8:7.4"], "en": "at that time, there was a third realization for thousands of millions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:8.1", "PA_bv_8:8.2"], "en": "There were three assemblies of the great seer Sobhita,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:8.3"], "en": "all of whom were stainless and had destroyed the taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:8.4"], "en": "To those of peaceful minds and steadfast nature,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:9.1", "PA_bv_8:9.2"], "en": "that king named Uggata gave gifts to the most excellent of men.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:9.3", "PA_bv_8:9.4"], "en": "A hundred koṭis of Arahants gathered for that almsgiving; furthermore,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:10.1"], "en": "a multitude of people [also assembled].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:10.2"], "en": "He gave gifts to the supreme among men;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:10.3", "PA_bv_8:10.4"], "en": "at that time, there was a second assembly of ninety koṭis.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:11.1", "PA_bv_8:11.2"], "en": "When the Jina, having dwelt in the world of the gods, descends from there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:11.3"], "en": "then for eighty koṭis—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:11.4"], "en": "There was a third meeting.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:12.1"], "en": "At that time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:12.2"], "en": "I was a brahmin named Sujāta.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:12.3", "PA_bv_8:12.4"], "en": "Then I satisfied the Buddha and his disciples with food and drink.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:13.1"], "en": "That Buddha also gave me this prediction:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:13.2"], "en": "“Sobhita, the Leader of the World,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:13.3"], "en": "declared: ‘In immeasurable aeons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:13.4"], "en": "this one shall become a Buddha.’”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:14.1"], "en": "Having exerted ourselves in striving,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:14.2", "PA_bv_8:14.3"], "en": "…pe… we shall stand face-to-face with this one.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:15.1"], "en": "Having heard her words as well,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:15.2"], "en": "joyful and with a heart moved by spiritual urgency,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:15.3"], "en": "he set out to attain that very goal.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:15.4"], "en": "I displayed great fortitude.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:16.1"], "en": "There was a city named Sudhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:16.2"], "en": "and a kshatriya named Sudhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:16.3", "PA_bv_8:16.4"], "en": "The mother of the Great Sage Sobhita was named Sudhammā;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:17.1"], "en": "for nine thousand years—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:17.2"], "en": "He dwelt in a house;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:17.3", "PA_bv_8:17.4"], "en": "there were three supreme palaces named Kumuda, Nālina, and Paduma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:18.1", "PA_bv_8:18.2"], "en": "Seventy-seven thousand women were beautifully adorned;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:18.3"], "en": "that woman was named Maṇilā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:18.4"], "en": "You were born as the son named Sīha;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:19.1"], "en": "having seen four omens,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:19.2"], "en": "you went forth from the palace.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:19.3"], "en": "Having practiced the course of striving for seven days,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:19.4"], "en": "the Supreme Person,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:20.1"], "en": "being entreated by Brahmā, consented.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:20.2"], "en": "Sobhita, the leader of the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:20.3", "PA_bv_8:20.4"], "en": "the Great Hero, turned the wheel of Dhamma in the supreme Sudhamma garden.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:21.1", "PA_bv_8:21.2"], "en": "Asama and Sunetta were his chief disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:21.3"], "en": "the one named Anoma was his attendant.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:21.4"], "en": "Of Sobhita, the Great Sage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:22.1", "PA_bv_8:22.2"], "en": "Nakulā and Sujātā were the foremost female disciples.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:22.3", "PA_bv_8:22.4"], "en": "Awakening, that Buddha awakened at the foot of the Nāga tree;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:23.1"], "en": "he was both delightful and well-given.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:23.2"], "en": "They were the chief attendants;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:23.3", "PA_bv_8:23.4"], "en": "Nakula and Citta were the chief attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:24.1", "PA_bv_8:24.2"], "en": "The Great Sage, risen eighty cubits high,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:24.3"], "en": "illuminates all directions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:24.4"], "en": "He has risen like the four-rayed sun.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:25.1", "PA_bv_8:25.2"], "en": "Just as a forest in full bloom is perfumed with various fragrances;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:25.3", "PA_bv_8:25.4"], "en": "In the same way, his teaching is perfumed with the fragrance of virtue,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:26.1"], "en": "just like that which is called the ocean.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:26.2"], "en": "He is not satiated by seeing;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:26.3", "PA_bv_8:26.4"], "en": "likewise, his teaching is not satiated by hearing.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:27.1"], "en": "For ninety thousand years,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:27.2"], "en": "his lifespan lasts for that long;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:27.3"], "en": "remaining for that duration, he—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:27.4"], "en": "He ferried across a great multitude of people;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:28.1", "PA_bv_8:28.2"], "en": "having given counsel and instruction to the remaining folk, he departed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:28.3"], "en": "Having scorched [all defilements] like a fire,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:28.4"], "en": "he has attained Nibbāna together with his disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:29.1"], "en": "he is the Buddha, the peerless and unequaled.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:29.2"], "en": "Those disciples too have attained power;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:29.3"], "en": "all that has vanished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:29.4"], "en": "Are not all conditioned phenomena empty?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:30.1", "PA_bv_8:30.2"], "en": "The supreme Buddha Sobhita attained Nibbāna at Sīhārāma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:30.3"], "en": "his relics were widely distributed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:30.4"], "en": "“From various regions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_8:31.1"], "en": "This is the sixth chapter on the lineage of the Blessed One Sobhita.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:46:26Z"}
]
